          "retweet_count": 41
        },
        "reply_settings": "everyone",
        "text": "Everyone says GPT-4o was better than GPT-5. We stopped guessing and measured it.\n2,310 controlled comparisons. 8 judges. 5 providers. ~12,400 evaluations.\nResult: creativity dropped 6.7x. False refusal rose 4.4x. Benchmarks caught none of it.\nPaper: https://t.co/AExXM0Bnc0 https://t.co/5cxWd8XiwK"
      }
